["The Prankster"]={description="Alcander and Ahaadah want you to help Tinga-Matonga become a respectable citizen.",fame="Treasures of Aht Urhgan",id=60,reward="Map of Caedarva Mire (If you do not already own it)\n2,000 Experience Points\n2,000 Gil",start_npc="Ahaadah",start_pos="G-6",start_zone="Aht Urhgan Whitegate"},
["The Prince and the Hopper"]={description="You have been hired by Professor Clavauert B Chanoix to accompany him and his guinea toad, Salwa- Molwa, to Mamook where they will conduct research on the elusive Poroggo.",fame="Treasures of Aht Urhgan",id=67,reward="Chanoix's Gorget",start_npc="Maudaal",start_pos="E-9",start_zone="Aht Urhgan Whitegate"},
["The Rider Cometh"]={description="Ominous rumors circulating among the mercenary ranks speak of Dark Rider sightings deep within the Hazhalm Testing Grounds. Could this occurrence bear any connection to the unsealed spatial distortion? It falls to you to investigate.",fame="Treasures of Aht Urhgan",id=76,next={"Unwavering Resolve"},reward="Imperial Gold Piece\nChoice of one:\n:* Pact with Odin\n:* 10,000 gil\nAccess to [Key Item]Stygian Pact phantom gem",start_npc="Nashmeira",start_zone="Imperial Ward",title="Heir of the Blighted Gloom"},
["The Wayward Automaton"]={description="Iruki-Waraki's automaton has been stolen! Go to Nashmau and see if you can find some information on its whereabouts.",fame="Aht Urhgan",id=27,next={"Operation Teatime"},previous={"No Strings Attached"},repeatable="No",reward="Turbo Animator",start_npc="Iruki-Waraki",start_pos="K-9",start_zone="Aht Urhgan Whitegate"},
["Three Men and a Closet"]={description="The three volunteer soldiers Foudeel, Wahboud, and Bashraf have been acting strange lately.  To help Kubhe find out what is really going on, you must first travel to Wajaom Woodlands and train with Foudeel.",fame="Aht Urhgan",id=31,previous={"Got It All"},repeatable="No",reward="Imp. Brz. Piece",start_npc="Kubhe Ijyuhla",start_pos="I-8",start_zone="Aht Urhgan Whitegate"},
["Totoroon's Treasure Hunt"]={description="\"Totoroon find soooper-doooper treasooor? A sooperb find!\". He will tell you where it is hidden in exchange for something sweet.",fame="Treasures of Aht Urhgan",id=18,repeatable="No",requirements={{count=1,name="Date, Pamamas, or Kazham Pineapple"}},reward="See Rewards section below",start_npc="Totoroon",start_pos="G-8",start_zone="Nashmau"},
["Transformations"]={description="A juvenile soulflayer has been discovered in the Alzadaal Undersea Ruins. Make your way to the ruins and eliminate this threat.",fame="Treasures of Aht Urhgan",id=23,next={"The Beast Within"},previous={"Omens"},repeatable="No",requirements={{count=1,name="1,000 Gil"},{count=1,name="Any one of the following:"},{count=1,name="*[Key Item] Remnants Permit"},{count=1,name="*Imperial Silver Piece"},{count=1,name="*[Key Item] Captain Wildcat badge"},{count=1,name="*[Key Item] Runic Portal Use Permit"}},reward="Magus Keffiyeh",start_npc="Waoud/Raubahn",start_pos="J-10",start_zone="Aht Urhgan Whitegate",title="Paragon of Blue Mage Excellence"},
["Two Horn the Savage"]={description="The ferocious \"Two Horn the Savage\" has been wreaking havoc around the Empire, but nobody knows the creature's identity or its whereabouts. You are to lead an investigation into the facts surrounding this frightening beast.",fame="Treasures of Aht Urhgan",id=17,reward="Imperial Mythril Piece",start_npc="Milazahn",start_pos="G-8",start_zone="Aht Urhgan Whitegate"},
["Unwavering Resolve"]={description="Ghatsad aims to seal the distortion that is the Dark Rider's portal into this world. You must procure another key and return to Hazhalm to collect the data he seeks. Meanwhile, Ovjang and Mnejing would ask of you a favor of their own...",fame="Treasures of Aht Urhgan",id=77,next={"A Stygian Pact"},previous={"The Rider Cometh"},repeatable="Yes",reward="Imperial Gold Piece\nChoice of one:\n:* Pact with Odin\n:* 10,000 gil",start_npc="Nashmeira",start_zone="Imperial Ward",title="Heir of the Blighted Gloom\nSworn to the Dark Divinity (For the final completion of the quest.)"},
["VW Op. #050: Aht Urhgan Assault"]={description="The Empire may refuse to recognize their existence, but planar rifts have indeed appeared in Arrapago Reef, Mount Zhayolm, Mamook, and Caedarva Mire. Eradicate each of the Voidwalker threats to save the realm!",fame="Treasures of Aht Urhgan",id=68,next={"VW Op. #068: Subterranean Skirmish"},reward="Amber stratum abyssite",start_npc="Camille",start_zone="Wajaom Woodlands"},
["VW Op. #068: Subterranean Skirmish"]={description="The Immortals have hinted at planar rift appearances in Aydeewa Subterrane. Venture underground to bore through this latest Voidwalker threat!",fame="Treasures of Aht Urhgan",id=69,previous={"VW Op. #050: Aht Urhgan Assault"},reward="Amber stratum abyssite II",start_npc="Camille",start_zone="Wajaom Woodlands"},
["Vanishing Act"]={description="The leader of the \"Epicureans\" has been missing ever since saying he was going to the port. Where could he have gone...?",fame="Aht Urhgan",id=62,next={"A Taste of Honey"},previous={"Delivering the Goods"},reward="Imperial Silver Piece",start_npc="Ulamaal",start_pos="K-12",start_zone="Aht Urhgan Whitegate"},
["Waking the Colossus"]={description="Curious readings from the chamber where the iron colossus sleeps have Imperial researchers ill at ease. At Her Majesty's behest, seek the support of the four nations for a plan to repair the colossus and free the Empire from its shadow once and for all.",fame="Treasures of Aht Urhgan",id=74,next={"Divine Interference"},reward="Imperial Gold Piece\nChoice of one:\n* Pact with Alexander\n*Colossus's Torque \n*Colossus's Mantle \n*Colossus's Earring \n* 10,000 gil",start_npc="Nashmeira",start_zone="Imperial Ward",title="Heir of the Blessed Radiance"},
["What Friends Are For"]={description="Tsetseroon needs a cobalt jellyfish and a chunk of tin ore to make his special stew.",fame="Aht Urhgan",id=19,requirements={{count=1,id=641,name="Tin Ore"},{count=1,id=4443,name="Cobalt Jellyfish"},{count=1,id=796,ki=true,name="Pot of Tsetseroon's stew"}},reward="Map of Aydeewa Subterrane (If you do not already own it)\nImperial Bronze Piece (Only if certain options are chosen)\n2,000 Experience Points\n2,000 Gil",start_npc="Tsetseroon",start_pos="G-6",start_zone="Nashmau"},
["When the Bow Breaks"]={description="Find the Galeserpent General in the Wajaom Woodlands, where she spends her spare time gazing on some object from her past...",fame="Aht Urhgan",id=45,repeatable="No",requirements={{count=1,id=2462,name="Frayed Arrow"}},reward="500 Imperial Standing",start_npc="Gaweesh",start_pos="G-8",start_zone="Al Zahbi",title="Galeserpent Guardian"},
